      "content": "<p>Highest oxidation state of Mn is exhibited in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The correct statements about <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are</p>\n<p>(A) Mn is tetrahedrally surrounded by oxygen atoms.</p>\n<p>(B) Mn is octahedrally surrounded by oxygen atoms.</p>\n<p>(C) Contains Mn-O-Mn bridge.</p>\n<p>(D) Contains Mn-Mn bond.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
