      "explanation": "<p>The correct statements about <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are:</p>\n\n<p>(A) Mn is tetrahedrally surrounded by oxygen atoms.</p>\n<p>(C) Contains Mn-O-Mn bridge.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1ldplhphd/0cf09014-aa6f-445a-921f-fba14d6e12ff/12456b10-a458-11ed-aba0-c590fd487309/file-1ldplhphe.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1ldplhphd/0cf09014-aa6f-445a-921f-fba14d6e12ff/12456b10-a458-11ed-aba0-c590fd487309/file-1ldplhphe.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 1st February Morning Shift Chemistry - d and f Block Elements Question 102 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1ldplhphd/0cf09014-aa6f-445a-921f-fba14d6e12ff/12456b10-a458-11ed-aba0-c590fd487309/file-1ldplhphe.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1ldplhphd/0cf09014-aa6f-445a-921f-fba14d6e12ff/12456b10-a458-11ed-aba0-c590fd487309/file-1ldplhphe.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1ldplhphd/0cf09014-aa6f-445a-921f-fba14d6e12ff/12456b10-a458-11ed-aba0-c590fd487309/file-1ldplhphe.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1ldplhphd/0cf09014-aa6f-445a-921f-fba14d6e12ff/12456b10-a458-11ed-aba0-c590fd487309/file-1ldplhphe.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1ldplhphd/0cf09014-aa6f-445a-921f-fba14d6e12ff/12456b10-a458-11ed-aba0-c590fd487309/file-1ldplhphe.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1ldplhphd/0cf09014-aa6f-445a-921f-fba14d6e12ff/12456b10-a458-11ed-aba0-c590fd487309/file-1ldplhphe.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n\n<p>Manganese (Mn) in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> exhibits its highest oxidation state of +7. The oxidation state is the charge an atom would have if the electrons in a chemical bond were shared equally.\n</p>\n<p>In <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the manganese atoms are surrounded by oxygen atoms in a tetrahedral arrangement. This means that each manganese atom is bonded to four oxygen atoms arranged in a pyramid shape. This tetrahedral arrangement of oxygen atoms results in the highest oxidation state for manganese in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> also contains Mn-O-Mn bridges, which are bonds between two manganese atoms through a shared oxygen atom. These bonds help to reinforce the structure of the molecule and contribute to its stability.</p>\n\n<p>It is incorrect to state that Mn is octahedrally surrounded by oxygen atoms or that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> contains a Mn-Mn bond. An octahedral arrangement would consist of six oxygen atoms surrounding a central manganese atom, and a Mn-Mn bond would involve two manganese atoms sharing electrons without an oxygen atom in between. Neither of these are present in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.068ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3124.1 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(917,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1506,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1909.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>"
    }
